e among the gods.\n\r\n\n\r\nLegendary gaming features:\n\r\n• Battle through ancient worlds with your favorite characters from the movie in the only game where you become Disney's Hercules.\n\r\n• Ten stages of heroic gameplay where you battle the Titans, defend Thebes, rescue Meg from the Underworld and more.\n\r\n• Hidden areas, Herculade power-ups and magical weapons ensure hours of replayability. Mystery \"\"passwords\"\" let you finish gameplay later.\n\r\n• All the excitement and humor of the movie come to life with original character voices, music and actual sequences from the film.\n\r\n• Multiple levels of difficulty make it perfect for gamers of all ages.","aboutGame":null},"vi":{"status":"pending_translation","provider":null,"shortDescription":null,"detailedDescription":null,"aboutGame":null}},"media":{"images":[{"role":"header","url":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/987400/header.jpg?t=1768503985"},{"role":"capsule","url":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/987400/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768503985"}],"screenshots":[{"id":0,"thumbnailUrl":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/987400/ss_b500387a4e86cd3a27d103ca2505b39854807134.600x338.jpg?t=1768503985","url":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/987400/ss_b500387a4e86cd3a27d103ca2505b39854807134.1920x1080.jpg?t=1768503985"},{"id":1,"thumbnailUrl":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/987400/ss_2915192dae378edf26b3817fd492016c140df0ad.600x338.jpg?t=1768503985","url":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/987400/ss_2915192dae378edf26b3817fd492016c140df0ad.1920x1080.jpg?t=1768503985"},{"id":2,"thumbnailUrl":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/987400/ss_1e5e739cb4d527fcd7a74f99026826c72bc275dc.600x338.jpg?t=1768503985","url":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/98740